    "tpb_seq": 1,
    "tpb_book": "<div>1. Shakespeare&#39;s Sonnets</div>\n\n<div>2. Histories--<em>Richard II</em></div>\n\n<div>3. Tragedies--<em>Romeo and Juliet</em></div>\n\n<div>4. Comedies--<em>Twelfth Night</em></div>\n\n<div>5. Tragicomedies--<em>The Tempest</em></div>\n\n<div>All of the above will come from--https://www.folger.edu/explore/shakespeares-works/download/</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
